to me there, and a chance to return to something that was a big part of my life. Fred arrived at the dream day with an intent to save our every moment. When I'm getting up in the morning, as always, part of the ritual that's exciting, thrilling, waking up in the dark, getting coffee at the cabin, taking the maps, getting all our gear together,
